Third-party material

The textures in media/ were taken from two MIT-licensed projects by
Karl-Heinz Schneider (Copyright (c) 2022-2026 Karl-HeinzSchneider):
  - DragonflightUI (https://github.com/Karl-HeinzSchneider/WoW-DragonflightUI):
    HD (2x) frame borders, masks, the player corner piece and elite dragons.
  - SeamlessUnitframes (https://github.com/Karl-HeinzSchneider/WoW-SeamlessUI):
    bar fills, the player portrait mask and the combat glows.
The addon icon (media/icon.tga) is composed from those same textures.
The frame offsets in Frames.lua follow the WoW Forever client's pre-70425
layout as restored by SeamlessUnitframes, and the target and focus heal
prediction follows its approach. Both projects are distributed under
the MIT License with the same terms as above. The artwork itself is
Blizzard Entertainment's World of Warcraft art.
